        "original_id": "dc4f7bd5-580e-5de2-8099-307fe7eca9cd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Minnesota Timberwolves, Phoenix Suns, Houston Rockets, National Basketball Association, NBA All-Star Game, All-NBA Team\n- People: Sam Cassell, Robert Horry, Rex Chapman\n- Events: 1996–97 Phoenix Suns season, 2003–04 NBA season, 2004–05 NBA season\n\nFacts:\n- During the offseason before the 1996–97 Phoenix Suns season, the Phoenix Suns acquired Sam Cassell and Robert Horry from the Houston Rockets and signed free agent Rex Chapman.\n- In the 2003–04 NBA season, Sam Cassell was selected to the NBA All-Star Game and the All-NBA Team, and those were his only selections to those honors.\n- The 2004–05 NBA season was the 16th season for the Minnesota Timberwolves in the National Basketball Association.",
